      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_14",
      "hash64": "44319DA642381BF8",
      "text": "The name’s Perrin. A photographer with a\\nrenewed love of photography![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_15",
      "hash64": "44319EA642381DAB",
      "text": "I can say that with pride now![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_16",
      "hash64": "44319FA642381F5E",
      "text": "AH! And your reward![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_17",
      "hash64": "4431A0A642382111",
      "text": "You’ve earned yourself a real choice reward for\\nall the help you’ve been![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_18",
      "hash64": "443199A64238152C",
      "text": "Oh, and this Growlithe of mine has a younger\\nbrother that really loves battling...[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_19",
      "hash64": "44319AA6423816DF",
      "text": "I think you’ll do a better job of raising it good\\nand strong.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 61,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_system_01",
      "hash64": "FB7A90977AC48E50",
      "text": "You received a Growlithe from Perrin!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_20",
      "hash64": "443B93A642405F7F",
      "text": "Raise it to be reeeaaal strong, OK?[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_21",
      "hash64": "443B92A642405DCC",
      "text": "I think that about wraps it up. I did what I came\\nhere to do, so I guess I should hit the road.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 95,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_22",
      "hash64": "443B95A6424062E5",
      "text": "I’m afraid this is good-bye.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_23",
      "hash64": "443B94A642406132",
      "text": "But you know, Growlithe like these are known for\\nliving and working together in pairs.[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_camera_24",
      "hash64": "443B8FA6424058B3",
      "text": "Even if they are separated for a while, I bet\\ntheir paths might just cross again someday...\\r\\nso you raise that one with care in the meantime![VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 143,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_select_05",
      "hash64": "7574A056FDB0F677",
      "text": "We’ll definitely meet again!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "s1_side02_0060_select_06",
      "hash64": "7574A156FDB0F82A",
      "text": "I’ll raise this Growlithe to be strong!",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
